          "format": "title"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Binding Dream] Connects a thread to the furthest allied unit within Attack Range, dealing continuous Arts damage",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Dissociative Sensation] Connects to enemies with threads, causing most of the damage taken by Morpheus to be split among them",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Evolution of Dream] Morpheus summons and rides a 'Sleep Companion Beast', becomes unblockable, gains increased Movement Speed and Barrier; ends after some time has passed, or if the Barrier is destroyed",
          "format": "normal"
        },
        {
          "text": "Second Form",
          "format": "title"
